id: video-controls
section: Media and sound
item: A video's play/pause by tap: jihad-media-test.html's clip plays (its status counts), a tap on the video pauses it (the status holds across two reads)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html
kit: cavekit-gre-widgets.md R1
# the page starts its clip by itself, with sound: the shipped default refuses that (T-603, off by the owner), so this test turns it on
prefs: jihad.media.autoplayWithSound=true
wait rect status 20
calibrate status
tap 'sel:video'
wait changed 'sel:video' 8
wait changed 'sel:video' 4
tap 'sel:video'
wait still 'sel:video' 6
sample paused 'sel:video'
wait still 'sel:video' 3
expect region-equal 'sel:video' paused
